   "title": "Senate Rejects Move To Revive Nigeria Air, Demands Direct Flights To China",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/senate-shelves-nigeria-air-revival-proposal-demands-direct-flights-to-china/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
