   "title": "Why some EU and Chinese firms are keen to cooperate even as tensions simmer",
   "url": "https://www.scmp.com/economy/china-economy/article/3372748/why-some-eu-and-chinese-firms-are-keen-cooperate-even-tensions-simmer",
   "domain": "scmp.com",
