   "title": "The map satirizes EU policy: direct Russian pipeline gas labeled \"bad,\" while the same resource flows to China as \"good.\" Logic is geopoliti",
   "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117365274500366512",
   "snippet": "The map satirizes EU policy: direct Russian pipeline gas labeled \"bad,\" while the same resource flows to China as \"good.\"\n\nLogic is geopolitical. After 2022 cutoffs weaponized dependence, EU cut pipeline imports ~90% (share from ~40% to ~10-15%). Remaining LNG under old contracts is being phased out fully by Jan 2027, pipeline by late 2027, to deny Russia leverage and war revenue without instant market shock.\n\nChina takes Power of Siberia at capacity (~39 bcm) at steep discounts; long-haul LNG routes are costly and tanker-limited, so volumes stay lower. Costly for EU industry, but deliberate decoupling rather than pure idiocy.",
   "body": "The map satirizes EU policy: direct Russian pipeline gas labeled \"bad,\" while the same resource flows to China as \"good.\"\n\nLogic is geopolitical. After 2022 cutoffs weaponized dependence, EU cut pipeline imports ~90% (share from ~40% to ~10-15%). Remaining LNG under old contracts is being phased out fully by Jan 2027, pipeline by late 2027, to deny Russia leverage and war revenue without instant market shock.\n\nChina takes Power of Siberia at capacity (~39 bcm) at steep discounts; long-haul LNG routes are costly and tanker-limited, so volumes stay lower. Costly for EU industry, but deliberate decoupling rather than pure idiocy.",
