   "platform": "x",
   "title": "India really didn’t have a problem with China in recent times, until Chinese soldiers decided to come for a picnic in the midst of a pandemi",
   "url": "https://x.com/vjamritraj/status/2117309048744022415",
   "snippet": "India really didn’t have a problem with China in recent times, until Chinese soldiers decided to come for a picnic in the midst of a pandemic to the Galwan valley in 2020. \n\nIt’s laughable when a Chinese talks about fence setting and balancing. That’s exactly what you were doing between the Soviet Union and USA. So you can keep your gospel to yourself.\n\nUnited States has critical technology and capital which India can benefit from, just the way China did. So we will continue to engage with USA even though they are difficult to deal with irrespective of what China thinks.\n\nThe government of India is elected by the people of the country. Good or bad is for them to decide, they are wise and will make changes whenever required. We are free people and not stymied by a dictator.\n\nIndia isn’t some small island nation around China that it will kneel before another nation. It’s a civilisational state, it has its own knowledge, wisdom and thinking and will always act in its own interests. \n\nIndia will rise due to its own merits. China cannot curtail India’s growth, sure it can place obstacles and create bottlenecks at the most. When India flips China on incremental GDP growth in 2031, the world will be talking a different story. Enjoy the sunshine till then.",
   "body": "India really didn’t have a problem with China in recent times, until Chinese soldiers decided to come for a picnic in the midst of a pandemic to the Galwan valley in 2020. \n\nIt’s laughable when a Chinese talks about fence setting and balancing. That’s exactly what you were doing between the Soviet Union and USA. So you can keep your gospel to yourself.\n\nUnited States has critical technology and capital which India can benefit from, just the way China did. So we will continue to engage with USA even though they are difficult to deal with irrespective of what China thinks.\n\nThe government of India is elected by the people of the country. Good or bad is for them to decide, they are wise and will make changes whenever required. We are free people and not stymied by a dictator.\n\nIndia isn’t some small island nation around China that it will kneel before another nation. It’s a civilisational state, it has its own knowledge, wisdom and thinking and will always act in its own interests. \n\nIndia will rise due to its own merits. China cannot curtail India’s growth, sure it can place obstacles and create bottlenecks at the most. When India flips China on incremental GDP growth in 2031, the world will be talking a different story. Enjoy the sunshine till then.",
