   "snippet": "Trade volume with China has increased overall, driven by rising imports.\n\nNepal imported Rs 425 bn from China in FY 2025/26, up 24.7% from Rs 341 bn the prior year. Exports stayed tiny at ~Rs 1.9 bn (often declining). \n\nCurrent FY 2026/27 shows continued growth; Mustang alone cleared Rs 26 bn in imports (incl. 6501 EVs) in 3.5 months—already far above its full prior-year total—amid border shifts.",
